                "entry_id": "5bc92834-9772-3af7-afd6-8a88facf3fb6",
                "word": "graflegging",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "nl",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "ec1cbaad-99a0-4646-b879-2facc64a560b",
                        "entry_id": "5bc92834-9772-3af7-afd6-8a88facf3fb6",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "grafleggingen"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4d2d6603-9ea8-3bcd-ab81-d73538531cbd",
                        "entry_id": "5bc92834-9772-3af7-afd6-8a88facf3fb6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "het begraven van iemand"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a26f5d51-3546-4617-9627-a9bcf620bc3a",
                                "sense_id": "4d2d6603-9ea8-3bcd-ab81-d73538531cbd",
                                "text": "Vrijdagavond vindt de processie plaats met voorop een kist met daarop een geborduurd kleed, de epitafios, met daarop afgebeeld de graflegging van Jezus."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "395669e4-aa77-4446-8105-9002d67f44bf",
                                "sense_id": "4d2d6603-9ea8-3bcd-ab81-d73538531cbd",
                                "text": "Op donderdag komt de instelling van het avondmaal aan bod, op vrijdag Christus’ kruisiging en dood en op zaterdag de graflegging. De zondag is een speciale dag voor meditatie, waarop Gods schepping, maar vooral Christus’ opstanding centraal staat."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "34789cc5-b523-47db-90e7-c1065409d5fd",
                                "sense_id": "4d2d6603-9ea8-3bcd-ab81-d73538531cbd",
                                "text": "Gevraagd naar zo’n fraai detail vertelt Mijksenaar over de tekening die IKEA gebruikt om duidelijk te maken dat bijvoorbeeld een keukentafel te zwaar is om alleen te tillen. „Dan krijg je een tekening waarbij twee of drie mensen met het voorwerp in de weer zijn. Die plaatjes doen me denken aan renaissanceschilderijen met de graflegging van Christus.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8751066c-8005-463b-a140-38d50897045b",
                        "source_entry_id": "5bc92834-9772-3af7-afd6-8a88facf3fb6",
                        "source_sense_id": "4d2d6603-9ea8-3bcd-ab81-d73538531cbd",
                        "target_lang_word": "funeral",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "funeral",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "df65c748-87c9-3a2e-b07b-6de657f1bb5d",
                                        "entry_id": "7ade1cfe-49be-36b8-8752-4901b71e3f59",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A ceremony to honor and remember a deceased person, often distinguished from a memorial service by the presence of the body of the deceased."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "22ccce80-a10c-4019-8f2b-b47136cdb65a",
                                                "sense_id": "df65c748-87c9-3a2e-b07b-6de657f1bb5d",
                                                "text": "Many mourners turned up at the local artist's funeral to pay homage."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "67d4b5b4-971e-4cd9-a192-1335652d2f48",
                                                "sense_id": "df65c748-87c9-3a2e-b07b-6de657f1bb5d",
                                                "text": "The taking Away of Righteous & Merciful Perſons muſt be taken to Heart, APPLIED IN A SERMON AT THE FUNERALLS OF Mʳⁱˢ ANNE-MARY CHILD. Wife of THOMAS CHILD Eſq. of North-wick in the Pariſh of Blockley. Worceſter-ſhire.[…]TO THE Exemplarily Vertuous Gentle-woman, his much honoured friend, Mʳˢ ANNE CHILD, Eldeſt daughter of THOMAS CHILD of Northwicke Eſquire. AS I mean not an exerciſe for your modeſty by a flattering Epiſtle, ſo neither doe I intend the renewing of your ſorrows, by preſenting you with the plaine Sermon preach’t at the funerals of your bleſſed Mother."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "272ba5b9-e2ff-3a5c-8387-ee7471d5f11d",
                                        "entry_id": "7ade1cfe-49be-36b8-8752-4901b71e3f59",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A funeral sermon."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated",
                                            "in-plural"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "funeral",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6c07c695-0466-35bf-82ed-a285b8372b3d",
                                        "entry_id": "f093c63b-2704-334c-ac96-57861e1b64b1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alternative spelling of funereal."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "alternative",
                                            "not-comparable",
                                            "uncommon",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c96085d9-c6c9-48ac-935b-5754718bd509",
                                                "sense_id": "6c07c695-0466-35bf-82ed-a285b8372b3d",
                                                "text": "All was funeral gloom and hope never whispered its cheering promises there."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0aa06d08-de3b-4065-a7c9-78fd71443211",
                                                "sense_id": "6c07c695-0466-35bf-82ed-a285b8372b3d",
                                                "text": "Indeed I felt it altogether beautiful; and, as the \"dying day-hymn stole aloft,\" the dim sun-beams fell, through a vista of naked motionless trees, upon the coffin, which was borne with a slower and more funeral pace than before, in a manner that threw a solemn and visionary light upon the whole procession."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f594f0c3-d855-4c30-a42b-803e08f4cebb",
                                                "sense_id": "6c07c695-0466-35bf-82ed-a285b8372b3d",
                                                "text": "There was something dramatic and theatrical in the very funeral ceremonies with which Demetrius was honored."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fa36a62a-29fc-41a6-982e-ca33586c6e53",
                                                "sense_id": "6c07c695-0466-35bf-82ed-a285b8372b3d",
                                                "text": "The very funeral pageantry disguised behind-the-scenes struggles for control over Sidney's image."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a417d234-414b-4ead-90cb-2b064e42eb17",
                        "source_entry_id": "5bc92834-9772-3af7-afd6-8a88facf3fb6",
                        "source_sense_id": "4d2d6603-9ea8-3bcd-ab81-d73538531cbd",
                        "target_lang_word": "burial",
